Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: PL/Zig
Upstream-Contact: PL/Zig maintainers <plzig@invalid>
Comment:
 The binary packages contain plzig.so (PL/Zig and, statically linked, the
 WebAssembly Micro Runtime, WAMR 2.4.5, with PL/Zig's patch
 third_party/wamr-interrupt.patch) and plzig-validate (PL/Zig and parts of
 the Zig standard library). The WAMR source is the orig-wamr component
 tarball (unpacked as wamr/). The Zig compiler used for the build comes
 from the plzig-zig-toolchain package and is not part of this source.
 See THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.

